sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Api as ItemsHandler<br/>src/App/App.Host/Api/Http/Endpoint/ItemsHandler.cs
    participant Sender as ScopedSender<br/>src/BuildingBlocks/Pipeline/ScopedSender.cs
    participant Failures as StoreFailuresMiddleware<br/>src/Middleware/StoreFailures/StoreFailuresMiddleware.cs
    participant Handler as AddItemHandler<br/>src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Commands/AddItemHandler.cs
    participant List as ItemList<br/>src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Domain/Entities/ItemList.cs
    participant Repository as PostgresRepository of ItemList<br/>src/Infrastructure/Postgres/Postgres/Repositories/PostgresRepository.cs
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Api->>+Sender: Send(AddItemCommand)
    Note over Sender: opens the command's scope: one AppDbContext
    Sender->>+Failures: Handle, after the logging middleware
    Failures->>+Handler: Handle
    Handler->>+Repository: SingleOrDefaultAsync(ListById)
    Repository->>DB: SELECT lists JOIN list_items
    Repository-->>-Handler: the list with its items, tracked
    Handler->>+List: Add(item)
    alt the title is in the list
        List-->>Handler: conflict, ItemAlreadyInList
    else a new title
        List-->>-Handler: added
        Handler->>+Repository: UpdateAsync(list)
        Repository->>+DB: SaveChangesAsync: INSERT INTO list_items
        alt the row is stored
            DB-->>Repository: the id of the item
            Repository-->>Handler: saved
        else another command stored the title meanwhile
            DB-->>-Repository: 23505
            Repository-->>-Handler: DbUpdateException, the tracker cleared
        end
    end
    Handler-->>-Failures: AddItemResult, or the failure
    Note over Failures: 23505 becomes conflict, the failure its cause, and a conflict of the list passes as it is
    Failures-->>-Sender: the result, or the error with its kind
    Note over Sender: disposes the scope and its context
    Sender-->>-Api: the result, or the error
